        "x": 1540,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n005": {
        "id": "n005",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "为什么……为什么拿这个鬼东西指着我们……你明明知道它是邪恶的！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n005:continue"
        },
        "x": 1840,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n006": {
        "id": "n006",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "不，不，不，你们才无疑是邪恶的。我只为自保，现在你们是不是被我的法术定住动不了了？你们有想过那些无辜的活人祭品，他们在被你们束缚无法动弹时也是绝望的？哈，哈，哈！你们捆人就像捆螃蟹！而我，我将逃离你们的追逐，彻底挫败你们的献祭计划。我将在一个更好的环境里，开启一段崭新的，美好的，不被邪教阴谋所困扰的人生！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n006:continue"
        },
        "x": 2140,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n007": {
        "id": "n007",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "等一下，危险，停！你在往海里跑，这是凹岸，海里是有离岸流的！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n007:continue"
        },
        "x": 2440,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n008": {
        "id": "n008",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "不要再蛊惑我了！新生活，我来了！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n008:continue"
        },
        "x": 2740,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n009": {
        "id": "n009",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n009:continue"
        },
        "x": 3040,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n010": {
        "id": "n010",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "ajie",
          "text": "离岸流给卷走了！我看不见人影！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n010:continue"
        },
        "x": 3340,
        "y": 40
      },
      "n011": {
        "id": "n011",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "那咋办？报警，找救生员？都试一遍吧。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n011:continue"
        },
        "x": 3640,
        "y": 40
